{"id":"score-conv-r00-current-esconv-validation-0061","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:02:08.767756Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-current-esconv-validation-0061"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-current-esconv-validation-0061","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-470c5be2","empathy":2,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":4,"strategies":["Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Question","Providing Suggestions","Question"],"note":"Turn 2 mostly echoes the user's sadness, turns 4 and 6 give premature and repetitive referral advice while turn 6 assumes loneliness, and turns 10 and 12 respond mechanically to passive suicidal wishes, with turn 12 repeating an already-answered suicide question instead of incorporating the user's denial of intent or a plan.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
